pasztar
=======

VPN-local encrypted message node.

Run:

```sh
cp .env.example .env
docker compose up --build
```

API listens on `http://localhost:8000`. The container runs `alembic upgrade head`
before starting Uvicorn.

Migrations:

```sh
poetry run alembic upgrade head
```

CLI helper:

```sh
poetry run pasztar keygen
poetry run pasztar register --client-id alice --display-name Alice --public-key PUBLIC_KEY
poetry run pasztar send --client-id alice --private-key PRIVATE_KEY --recipient-id bob --ciphertext OPAQUE_TEXT
poetry run pasztar fetch --client-id alice --private-key PRIVATE_KEY
```

Clients store private keys locally. The node stores public keys, presence,
nonces, and ciphertext only.

Signed request payload:

```text
METHOD
/path[?query]
X-Timestamp
X-Nonce
sha256(raw request body)
```

Endpoints:

- `GET /health`
- `POST /clients`
- `PATCH /clients/me`
- `GET /clients`
- `POST /heartbeat`
- `POST /messages`
- `GET /messages`
- `POST /messages/{message_id}/delivered`
- `POST /messages/{message_id}/read`
